  sentences:
  - name: Witness
    text: I was there earlier. Not when it happened - Before.
  - name: Witness
    text: "Two people came by. Didn\u2019t buy anything. Just stood too close. I
      remember thinking they were waiting for someone else."
  - name: Witness
    text: "I keep wondering what would\u2019ve happened if I\u2019d stayed."
